  (text "KEY MATRIX: columns D4-D9 driven low one at a time, rows D1-D3 read with pull-ups (see scanButtonMatrix). Diode anode to switch, cathode to column." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 7.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "d01d89a6-8721-43c1-9855-ab059347c30f"))
  (text "C4 is a direct key on D10 to GND (firmware uses internal pull-up).  BTN1-6 = top-row buttons on the 6 unused matrix slots (NOTE_MAPPING -1 entries)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "50709124-7791-4650-afd7-0d918dc10da8"))
  (text "POTS: panel-mount 10k linear pots wired to 3-pin headers: 1 = +3V3A, 2 = wiper -> A0..A4, 3 = AGND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 198.12 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "2bf4c029-104a-40eb-b8b1-99043e1d9d03"))
  (text "POWER: USB-C only. VBUS -> 2A polyfuse -> +5V rail for Seed VIN and the amp. 5.1k CC pull-downs advertise a 1.5A sink." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 223.52 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "66e1b101-81e5-4ee1-b956-05b5789d3483"))
  (text "USB-C data to D29/D30 = Daisy 'external' USB. In firmware use MidiUsbTransport::Config::EXTERNAL." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "ad7d35bf-fdb6-4e5c-b542-2e7b7457ee96"))
  (text "AMP: MAX98306 on board, single-ended inputs (1u caps, - inputs to GND). Gain: R13 100k to PVDD = 9 dB, JP1 straps GAIN to GND (18 dB) or PVDD (12 dB). Outputs -> ferrite + 220p EMI filter -> JST-PH." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 304.8 228.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cb48b6d1-035d-4303-8b8b-49bad67cf2ea"))
  (text "Outputs are bridge-tied: NO series caps on the speakers, never join L- and R-." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 304.8 233.68 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cda1d801-ebc8-489a-b1c3-efa5824fad9e"))
  (text "HEADPHONES: TPA6138A2 (gain -1, ground-centred output, no output caps) drives the jack. TN contact = plug detect (HP_DET). Q1 pulls the speaker amp SD low when plugged. D11 = speaker mute, D13 reads HP_DET, D14 = headphone mute (pulled up)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 50.8 299.72 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "b23cdbb6-5cd4-40aa-9d60-ac48d3b8389a"))
  (text "EXPANSION: spare Seed GPIO/ADC + 3V3/5V/GND for a future display, encoder, MIDI DIN, etc." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 508 86.36 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "4781cd42-75f5-4df7-b1fd-4130ec06fef3"))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
